      en: ["Zaqatala Fortress was built in 1830 following the Russian conquest", "Home to the country's oldest nature reserve, established in 1929", "About 50% of Azerbaijani hazelnuts are produced here", "The population consists of Azerbaijanis, Avars, and Tsakhurs", "Located at an elevation of 518 meters above sea level", "Features an international airport opened in the year 2008"],
